We cannot use query against the DataTable's Rows collection, since DataRowCollection doesn't implement IEnumerable<T>. We need to use the AsEnumerable() extension for DataTable. As an example:

                    var results = from myRow in myDataTable.AsEnumerable()
                    where myRow.Field<int>("RowNo") == 1
                    select myRow;

